          The launcher entry, one alias per icon, as on the phone: LauncherIcons (rc-components)
          enables the one matching the watch's card style and disables the rest. `default` is the
          themed-icon-capable adaptive icon and the one enabled on install. Widget taps target
          WearMainActivity itself, so they survive a switch.
        -->
